msgid "希望最终拿到“多配比 + 多随机占位”的 HEA 训练集。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:28
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:145
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md:253
